<title>UK: Bank of Scotland off on unit's warning.</title>
<headline>Bank of Scotland off on unit's warning.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in the Bank of Scotland tumbled on Thursday after the group's Australian subsidiary posted a profit warning, dealers said.</p>
<p>At 1043 GMT, the shares were down 12-1/2p to 343 on volume of 6.8 million shares. They were among the most actively traded shares in London.</p>
